            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Está no nosso sangue!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descobre um Universo de Mortal Kombat™ renascido criado pelo Liu Kang Deus do Fogo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/08e1c13913aee283407b008120943875.avif?t=1778795130\" width=610 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Novas Origens</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ilustrando a visão perfeita de Liu Kang Deus do Fogo, o novo universo de Mortal Kombat 1 é familiar, mas ao mesmo tempo radicalmente diferente.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/03f26ec03bac913bc7a13ab61e8d92f8.poster.avif?t=1778795130\" width=610 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/03f26ec03bac913bc7a13ab61e8d92f8.webm?t=1778795130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/03f26ec03bac913bc7a13ab61e8d92f8.mp4?t=1778795130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Invasões</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invasões é uma campanha dinâmica para um jogador que apresenta uma variedade de diferentes desafios. Inclui uma progressão incorporada e mecânicas de RPG que se combinam com a incrível ação de MK1. Invasões dá-te desafios complexos e envolventes, além de muitas recompensas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/f5be751649a267746402332590c9392a.poster.avif?t=1778795130\" width=610 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/f5be751649a267746402332590c9392a.webm?t=1778795130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/f5be751649a267746402332590c9392a.mp4?t=1778795130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kameos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Os Kameos melhoram todas as lutas em vários aspetos ao dar apoio a lutadores da equipa com os seus movimentos especiais, empurrões e golpes defensivos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/383d9a44620575ba3c32fd92635d4681.poster.avif?t=1778795130\" width=610 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/383d9a44620575ba3c32fd92635d4681.webm?t=1778795130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/383d9a44620575ba3c32fd92635d4681.mp4?t=1778795130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Está no nosso sangue!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descobre um Universo de Mortal Kombat™ renascido criado pelo Liu Kang Deus do Fogo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/08e1c13913aee283407b008120943875.avif?t=1778795130\" width=610 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Novas Origens</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ilustrando a visão perfeita de Liu Kang Deus do Fogo, o novo universo de Mortal Kombat 1 é familiar, mas ao mesmo tempo radicalmente diferente.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/03f26ec03bac913bc7a13ab61e8d92f8.poster.avif?t=1778795130\" width=610 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/03f26ec03bac913bc7a13ab61e8d92f8.webm?t=1778795130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/03f26ec03bac913bc7a13ab61e8d92f8.mp4?t=1778795130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Invasões</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invasões é uma campanha dinâmica para um jogador que apresenta uma variedade de diferentes desafios. Inclui uma progressão incorporada e mecânicas de RPG que se combinam com a incrível ação de MK1. Invasões dá-te desafios complexos e envolventes, além de muitas recompensas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/f5be751649a267746402332590c9392a.poster.avif?t=1778795130\" width=610 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/f5be751649a267746402332590c9392a.webm?t=1778795130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/f5be751649a267746402332590c9392a.mp4?t=1778795130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kameos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Os Kameos melhoram todas as lutas em vários aspetos ao dar apoio a lutadores da equipa com os seus movimentos especiais, empurrões e golpes defensivos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/383d9a44620575ba3c32fd92635d4681.poster.avif?t=1778795130\" width=610 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/383d9a44620575ba3c32fd92635d4681.webm?t=1778795130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971870/extras/383d9a44620575ba3c32fd92635d4681.mp4?t=1778795130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
